Input: {"question": "Who replaced Saint-Pierre-à-Champ in their role?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 85, "text": "**HEADLINE:** French Commune Merger: Saint-Pierre-à-Champ Absorbed into Val en Vignes"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 87, "end": 107, "text": "**DATE:** March 2019"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 109, "end": 337, "text": "In a move aimed at streamlining local governance and improving public services, the French commune of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ has officially been replaced by Val en Vignes, a commune in the Deux-Sèvres department of western France."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 338, "end": 519, "text": "According to official records, the merger was finalized on January 1, 2019, as part of a nationwide effort to consolidate rural communes and enhance their administrative efficiency."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 520, "end": 674, "text": "This move marks a significant shift in the region's administrative landscape, with Val en Vignes now serving as the primary governing entity for the area."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 675, "end": 802, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome the residents of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ into our community,\" said Val en Vignes Mayor, Pierre Dupont."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 803, "end": 912, "text": "\"This merger will enable us to pool our resources, reduce costs, and provide better services to our citizens."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 913, "end": 951, "text": "It's a win-win for everyone involved.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 952, "end": 1174, "text": "Data from the French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE) reveals that Saint-Pierre-à-Champ had a population of just 541 residents as of 2016, making it one of the smallest communes in the region."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1175, "end": 1302, "text": "In contrast, Val en Vignes boasts a population of over 2,000 residents, providing a more sustainable base for local governance."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1303, "end": 1519, "text": "\"The merger will allow us to maintain our rural way of life while benefiting from the economies of scale that come with being part of a larger community,\" said former Saint-Pierre-à-Champ Mayor, Marie-France Garnier."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1520, "end": 1618, "text": "\"We're excited to work together with our new neighbors to build a brighter future for our region.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1619, "end": 1757, "text": "The merger is part of a broader trend in France, where rural communes are facing declining populations and increasing financial pressures."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1758, "end": 1905, "text": "According to a report by the French Senate, over 1,000 communes have merged since 2015, with many more expected to follow suit in the coming years."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1906, "end": 2067, "text": "As the dust settles on this latest merger, residents of Val en Vignes and former Saint-Pierre-à-Champ are looking forward to a new era of cooperation and growth."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2068, "end": 2161, "text": "With a stronger, more unified community, the region is poised to thrive in the years to come."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "Saint-Pierre-à-Champ"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 22, "end": 115, "text": "Saint-Pierre-à-Champ was a former commune in France that existed until the late 19th century."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 116, "end": 255, "text": "According to historical records, the commune was replaced by the city of Paris in a series of events that took place between 1870 and 1880."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 256, "end": 269, "text": "Early History"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 270, "end": 283, "text": "-------------"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 285, "end": 370, "text": "Saint-Pierre-à-Champ was founded in the 12th century as a small agricultural village."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 371, "end": 484, "text": "The commune grew steadily over the centuries, becoming a significant center for trade and commerce in the region."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 485, "end": 598, "text": "By the 18th century, Saint-Pierre-à-Champ had become a thriving town with a population of over 5,000 inhabitants."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 599, "end": 638, "text": "The Replacement of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 639, "end": 675, "text": "------------------------------------"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 677, "end": 821, "text": "In the late 19th century, the French government embarked on a series of urbanization projects aimed at modernizing the country's infrastructure."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 822, "end": 953, "text": "As part of this effort, the government decided to expand the city of Paris, which had become a major hub for industry and commerce."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 954, "end": 1148, "text": "Studies conducted by the French Ministry of Urban Planning in the 1860s revealed that the expansion of Paris would require the absorption of surrounding communes, including Saint-Pierre-à-Champ."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1149, "end": 1344, "text": "The study, led by French urban planner Baron Haussmann, concluded that the incorporation of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ into Paris would provide a significant boost to the city's economy and population."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1345, "end": 1456, "text": "In 1875, the French National Assembly passed a law authorizing the annexation of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ by Paris."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1457, "end": 1587, "text": "The law was met with resistance from the residents of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ, who feared the loss of their autonomy and way of life."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1588, "end": 1693, "text": "However, the government ultimately prevailed, and the commune was officially absorbed into Paris in 1880."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1694, "end": 1703, "text": "Aftermath"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1704, "end": 1714, "text": "----------"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1716, "end": 1809, "text": "The replacement of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ by Paris had significant consequences for the region."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1810, "end": 1962, "text": "The absorption of the commune led to a significant increase in population and economic activity in Paris, cementing its status as the capital of France."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1963, "end": 2071, "text": "However, the loss of autonomy and identity for the residents of Saint-Pierre-à-Champ was a significant blow."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2072, "end": 2157, "text": "Many residents chose to leave the area, leading to a decline in the local population."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2158, "end": 2378, "text": "Today, the area that was once Saint-Pierre-à-Champ is a thriving neighborhood in Paris, but the memory of the former commune lives on as a testament to the complex and often contentious history of urbanization in France."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Val en Vignes", "Paris"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Val en Vignes", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Paris", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "person"}
